        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: No Good Duke Goes Unpunished, A Rogue by Any Other Name\n- People: Sarah MacLean\n- Organizations: Avon, Romance Writers of America\n- Awards: RITA Award for Best Historical Romance\n\nFacts:\n- Sarah MacLean wrote the historical romance novel No Good Duke Goes Unpunished, and Avon published it in 2013.\n- In 2013, the Romance Writers of America gave Sarah MacLean the RITA Award for Best Historical Romance for A Rogue by Any Other Name.\n- In 2014, the Romance Writers of America gave Sarah MacLean the RITA Award for Best Historical Romance for No Good Duke Goes Unpunished.",
